    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "Every person who administers or causes to be administered to any other person or causes any other person to take poison or any other destructive or noxious thing is guilty (a) ... if they did so with intent ... (b) ..." (marginal reading M1)

@ref s 245(1) (src:4844-4846)
